{"id":"script-checkout","locale":"en","title":"Checkout script","updated":"2026-09-25T18:39:17.692Z","baseHtml":"","content":{"type":"doc","content":[{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Checkout is a script embedded into your website that collects card details from a specified form and uses them to generate a cryptogram for payment processing via our API."}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"The cryptogram is generated using the RSA algorithm with a 2048-bit key length and meets the standard for card data protection. If the requirements described below are followed, card details will not be accessible to you, but your server still impacts their security. "}]},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"textAlign":null,"id":"section-bbe2cdd8-d4a8-42b7-925c-1629b4116654","level":2},"content":[{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"text":"Demo checkout"}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"A demonstration of the Checkout script is available in our demo store: "},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"link","attrs":{"href":"https://show.cloudpayments.ru/checkout/","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer","class":null,"title":null}}],"text":"https://show.cloudpayments.ru/checkout/"}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"You can use both test card details and real ones for testing. No funds will be debited."}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null}},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"textAlign":null,"id":"section-e6dea309-af39-4e43-ae92-eaee552bc90f","level":2},"content":[{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"text":"Requirements"}]},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"textAlign":null,"id":"section-a55f2427-4fda-4224-8941-e36a3854656a","level":3},"content":[{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"text":"Form requirements"}]},{"type":"bulletList","content":[{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Must operate over an HTTPS connection with a valid SSL certificate."}]}]},{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Form fields must not contain the "},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"code"}],"text":"name"},{"type":"text","text":" attribute, this prevents card details from reaching the server when the form is sent."}]}]},{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"The field for entering the card number must support entry of 16 to 19 digits."}]}]}]},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"textAlign":null,"id":"section-0080a13d-f748-4698-9625-a26d9180ce3d","level":3},"content":[{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"text":"Cryptogram requirements"}]},{"type":"bulletList","content":[{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Must be generated exclusively by the original checkout script loaded from the system's official addresses."}]}]},{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"The cryptogram must not be stored after the payment is made or reused for subsequent transactions."}]}]}]},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"textAlign":null,"id":"section-b065ec9a-01bf-418e-bb6c-9c80b15cdb76","level":3},"content":[{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"text":"PCI DSS security requirements"}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"From the PCI DSS perspective, this type of connection is classified as \"E-commerce merchants who outsource all payment processing to PCI DSS validated third parties, and who have a website(s) that doesn’t directly receive cardholder data but that can impact the security of the payment transaction. No electronic storage, processing, or transmission of any cardholder data on the merchant’s systems or premises,\", meaning that while payment data processing is handled by a third party, your website still impacts the security of card details."}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"To comply with the standard's requirements, complete the SAQ-EP self-assessment questionnaire and undergo ASV testing on quarterly basis."}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"For more information on PCI compliance, see the PCI DSS section.  "}]},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"textAlign":null,"id":"section-366a9332-313c-4eaa-b7e0-042bdb18270a","level":2},"content":[{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"text":"Installation"}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"To generate a cryptogram, embed the "},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"text":"checkout"},{"type":"text","text":" script into the payment form page:"}]},{"type":"codeBlock","attrs":{"language":"javascript"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"<script src=\"https://checkout.cloudpayments.ru/checkout.js\"></script>"}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null},"content":[{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"text":"Warning:"},{"type":"text","text":" Use "},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"code"}],"text":"checkout.js"},{"type":"text","text":" to maintain PCI compliance by ensuring that payment details are sent directly to CloudPayments without affecting your server. Always load "},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"code"}],"text":"checkout.js"},{"type":"text","text":" from "},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"link","attrs":{"href":"https://widget.cloudpayments.ru","target":"_blank","rel":"noopener noreferrer","class":null,"title":null}}],"text":"https://widget.cloudpayments.ru"},{"type":"text","text":" to remain compliant. Do not bundle the script or host it yourself."}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Choose the card data transmission method that best suits your needs:"}]},{"type":"bulletList","content":[{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Direct transmission to the script"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Input form"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Next, the generated cryptogram of a card must be sent to your server to trigger the payment method via API.  "}]},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"textAlign":null,"id":"section-b912e49e-a0d4-4b34-9c4b-52d4340657ea","level":3},"content":[{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"text":"The option of direct transmission to the script"}]},{"type":"orderedList","attrs":{"start":1,"type":null},"content":[{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Initialize the checkout script:"}]}]}]},{"type":"codeBlock","attrs":{"language":"javascript"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"const checkout = new cp.Checkout({\n    publicId: 'test_api_000000000000000002',\n});"}]},{"type":"orderedList","attrs":{"start":2,"type":null},"content":[{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Call the cryptogram generation method by passing the card details into it:"}]}]}]},{"type":"codeBlock","attrs":{"language":"javascript"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"const fieldValues = {\n    cvv: '911',\n    cardNumber: '4242 4242 4242 4242',\n    expDateMonth: '12',\n    expDateYear: '24',\n}\n\ncheckout.createPaymentCryptogram(fieldValues)\n    .then((cryptogram) => {\n        console.log(cryptogram);\n    }).catch((errors) => {\n        console.log(errors)\n    });"}]},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"textAlign":null,"id":"section-9cb5396e-8aee-41fa-b4a9-1521fa67ad15","level":3},"content":[{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"text":"The option with the input form"}]},{"type":"orderedList","attrs":{"start":1,"type":null},"content":[{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Create a card details input form:"}]}]}]},{"type":"codeBlock","attrs":{"language":"javascript"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"<form id=\"paymentFormSample\" autocomplete=\"off\">\n    <input type=\"text\" data-cp=\"cardNumber\">\n    <input type=\"text\" data-cp=\"expDateMonth\">\n    <input type=\"text\" data-cp=\"expDateYear\">\n    <input type=\"text\" data-cp=\"cvv\">\n    <input type=\"text\" data-cp=\"name\">\n    <button type=\"submit\">Pay 100 rubles.</button>\n</form>"}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"The input fields for card details must be tagged with the following attributes:"}]},{"type":"bulletList","content":[{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null},"content":[{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"text":"data-cp=\"cardNumber\""},{"type":"text","text":": card number field"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null},"content":[{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"text":"data-cp=\"expDateMonth\""},{"type":"text","text":": expiration month field"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null},"content":[{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"text":"data-cp=\"expDateYear\""},{"type":"text","text":": expiration year field"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null},"content":[{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"text":"data-cp=\"CVV\""},{"type":"text","text":": CVV field"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null},"content":[{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"text":"data-cp=\"name\""},{"type":"text","text":": field with the cardholder name and surname"}]}]}]},{"type":"orderedList","attrs":{"start":2,"type":null},"content":[{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Initialize the checkout script:"}]}]}]},{"type":"codeBlock","attrs":{"language":"javascript"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"const checkout = new cp.Checkout({\n    publicId: 'test_api_000000000000000002',\n    container: document.getElementById(\"paymentFormSample\")\n});"}]},{"type":"orderedList","attrs":{"start":3,"type":null},"content":[{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Call the cryptogram generation method:"}]}]}]},{"type":"codeBlock","attrs":{"language":"javascript"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"checkout.createPaymentCryptogram()\n    .then((cryptogram) => {\n        console.log(cryptogram); // The cryptogram\n    }).catch((errors) => {\n        console.log(errors)\n    });"}]},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"textAlign":null,"id":"section-e57f66f3-160a-4135-85d5-070cbc15cd9f","level":3},"content":[{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"text":"When developing your own form or passing data directly to the script, please note the following"}]},{"type":"bulletList","content":[{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"The card number length ranges from 16 digits (15 for AMEX cards) to 19 digits."}]}]},{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"The "},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"text":"checkout"},{"type":"text","text":" script does not operate in outdated, insecure browsers that lack support for TLS encryption protocols version 1.1 or later. For example, Internet Explorer 7."}]}]},{"type":"listItem","content":[{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"The 3DS window can be displayed either in a new window or in a frame that overlays the page. The window dimensions must be at least 500х500 pixels. _Checkout"}]}]}]},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"textAlign":null,"id":"section-6876043c-e268-44a9-9f57-c9bfc178351a","level":2},"content":[{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"text":"Methods"}]},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"textAlign":null,"id":"section-8d822b82-dc24-436c-ae58-84eae81cf19c","level":3},"content":[{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"text":"Asynchronous method used to generate a cryptogram"}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"In this method, if a card details validation error occurs, an error code will be returned instead of a localized message."}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null},"content":[{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"code"}],"text":"async createPaymentCryptogram(fieldValues: CardData): Promise<string>"}]},{"type":"paragraph","attrs":{"textAlign":null},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"The method returns the "},{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"code"}],"text":"Promise<string>"},{"type":"text","text":" containing the cryptogram. If the invalid data is passed, the Promise will be rejected with an error containing an object with a list of errors."}]},{"type":"codeBlock","attrs":{"language":"javascript"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"const checkout = new cp.Checkout({\n    publicId: 'test_api_000000000000000002'\n});\n\nconst fieldValues = {\n    cvv: '911',\n    cardNumber: '4242 4242 4242 4242',\n    expDateMonth: '12',\n    expDateYear: '24',\n}\n\ncheckout.createPaymentCryptogram(fieldValues)\n    .then((cryptogram) => {\n        console.log(cryptogram);\n    });"}]},{"type":"heading","attrs":{"textAlign":null,"id":"section-4e47699d-6849-404a-b183-e56d8374c689","level":3},"content":[{"type":"text","marks":[{"type":"bold"}],"text":"CardData object description"}]},{"type":"codeBlock","attrs":{"language":"javascript"},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"export interface CardData {\n    cvv?: string; // CVV/CVC code\n    cardNumber?: string; /